{"articleNo":"915","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=view&articleNo=915&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"도서관 일반열람실 좌석관리시스템 운영 알림","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2009.09.17","hit":"12844","attachments":[{"name":"좌석관리시스템 이용안내.hwp","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=download&articleNo=915&attachNo=69391"}],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<!--StartFragment-->\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 20pt; COLOR: #000080; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">【좌석관리시스템 이용안내】</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 6pt; COLOR: #000080; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\"><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; TEXT-ALIGN: left\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; COLOR: #000080; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">◉ 운영목적 :</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\"> 효율적인 일반열람실 운영</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; TEXT-ALIGN: left\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; COLOR: #000080; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">◉ 시 행 일</span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\"> </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">: 2009.09.21부터 시험운영 시작</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; TEXT-ALIGN: left\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; COLOR: #000080; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">◉ 이용대상 :</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\"> 재학생(휴학생포함), 교직원, 졸업생, 지역주민(초․중고생제외)</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; TEXT-ALIGN: left\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 9pt; COLOR: #0000ff; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">* 졸업생 및 지역주민은 이용신청서를 작성하여 도서관 열람팀&nbsp;301호 제1자료실 대출데스크로&nbsp;제출(제출양식등 자세한 내용은 도서관홈페이지열린마당-서식자료실 참고)&nbsp;<a href=\"http://library.kumoh.ac.kr/dliweb20/components/bbs/Read.aspx?bbsid=2&amp;m_var=450&amp;page=1&amp;articleid=2000&amp;no_menutitle=\">http:http://library.kumoh.ac.kr/dliweb20/components/bbs/Read.aspx?bbsid=2&amp;m_var=450&amp;page=1&amp;articleid=2000&amp;no_menutitle=</a>&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; TEXT-ALIGN: left\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; COLOR: #000080; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">◉</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; COLOR: #000080; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\"> </span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; COLOR: #000080; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">이용시간</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; COLOR: #000080; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\"> :</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; TEXT-ALIGN: left\">\n</p><table style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: medium none; BORDER-TOP: medium none; BORDER-LEFT: medium none; BORDER-BOTTOM: medium none; BORDER-COLLAPSE: collapse\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" border=\"1\">\n    <tbody>\n        <tr>\n            <td style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: medium none; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: medium none; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; BORDER-LEFT: medium none; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt; BORDER-BOTTOM: medium none\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"120\" bgcolor=\"#25489a\" height=\"21\">\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 120%; TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"COLOR: #ffffff; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">열람실별</span></p>\n            </td>\n            <td style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: medium none; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: medium none; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; BORDER-LEFT: medium none; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt; BORDER-BOTTOM: medium none\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"247\" bgcolor=\"#25489a\" height=\"21\">\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 120%; TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"COLOR: #ffffff; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">이용시간&nbsp;</span></p>\n            </td>\n            <td style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: medium none; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: medium none; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; BORDER-LEFT: medium none; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt; BORDER-BOTTOM: medium none\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"277\" bgcolor=\"#25489a\" height=\"21\">\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 120%; TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"COLOR: #ffffff; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">비고</span></p>\n            </td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr>\n            <td style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: medium none; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: medium none; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; BORDER-LEFT: medium none; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt; BORDER-BOTTOM: medium none\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"120\" bgcolor=\"#def1f8\" height=\"16\">\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 120%; TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">제1열람실(101호)</span></p>\n            </td>\n            <td style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: medium none; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: medium none; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; BORDER-LEFT: medium none; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt; BORDER-BOTTOM: medium none\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"247\" bgcolor=\"#def1f8\" height=\"51\" rowspan=\"3\">\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 120%\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">- 최초 6시간 이용, 3회 연장 가능</span></p>\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 120%\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp; </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 9pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 120%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">(이용종료시간 1시간 전부터 연장가능)</span></p>\n            </td>\n            <td style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: medium none; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: medium none; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; BORDER-LEFT: medium none; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt; BORDER-BOTTOM: medium none\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"277\" bgcolor=\"#def1f8\" height=\"51\" rowspan=\"3\">\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 120%\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">- 시험기간중 이용시간 변경(별도공지)</span></p>\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 120%\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">- </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 8pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 120%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">학내사정에 따라 지역주민 이용은 제한될 수 있음</span></p>\n            </td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr>\n            <td style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: medium none; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: medium none; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; BORDER-LEFT: medium none; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt; BORDER-BOTTOM: medium none\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"120\" bgcolor=\"#def1f8\" height=\"16\">\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 120%; TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">제2열람실(104호)</span></p>\n            </td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr>\n            <td style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: medium none; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: medium none; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; BORDER-LEFT: medium none; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt; BORDER-BOTTOM: medium none\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"120\" bgcolor=\"#def1f8\" height=\"16\">\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 120%; TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">제3열람실(201호)</span></p>\n            </td>\n        </tr>\n    </tbody>\n</table>\n<p></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; TEXT-ALIGN: left\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; COLOR: #000080; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">◉</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; COLOR: #000080; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\"> </span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; COLOR: #000080; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">좌석번호표 발급기 설치장소</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\"> : </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">도서관 1층 로비 : 2대,&nbsp; 2층 로비 : 1대</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; TEXT-ALIGN: left\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; COLOR: #000080; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">◉</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; COLOR: #000080; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\"> </span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; COLOR: #000080; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">이용절차</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; TEXT-ALIGN: left\">\n</p><table style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: medium none; BORDER-TOP: medium none; BORDER-LEFT: medium none; BORDER-BOTTOM: medium none; BORDER-COLLAPSE: collapse\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" border=\"1\">\n    <tbody>\n        <tr>\n            <td style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt; BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.4pt solid\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"197\" height=\"164\">\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\"><img height=\"147\" src=\"http://www.kumoh.ac.kr/file/upload/Image/1_2.jpg\" width=\"189\" alt=\"\"></span></p>\n            </td>\n            <td style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt; BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.4pt solid\" valign=\"top\" width=\"449\" height=\"164\">\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 100%; TEXT-ALIGN: left\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; COLOR: #000080; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;1. 이용자 인증</span></p>\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 100%; TEXT-ALIGN: left\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; COLOR: #000080; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp; </span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; COLOR: #ff00ff; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">가. ID 입력</span></p>\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 100%; TEXT-ALIGN: left\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp; ① 재학생 : 학생증 바코드 스캔</span></p>\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 100%; TEXT-ALIGN: left\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;바코드가 잘 읽히지 않는 경우 : </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 8pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 100%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">화면하단의 </span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 8pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 100%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">가상키보드 터치</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 8pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 100%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">→</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">학번입력</span></p>\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 100%; TEXT-ALIGN: left\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;② 교직원, 졸업생, 지역주민 : 바코드 스캔</span></p>\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 100%; TEXT-ALIGN: left\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; COLOR: #ff00ff; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;나. 비밀번호 입력</span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; COLOR: #000080; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\"> : 주민등록번호 뒷자리 </span></p>\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 100%; TEXT-ALIGN: left\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 8pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 100%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\"></span><span style=\"COLOR: #ff0000; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">※ 바코드발급(도서관 열람팀 301호 평일09:00-18:00까지)</span></p>\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 100%; TEXT-ALIGN: left\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 8pt; COLOR: #0000ff; LINE-HEIGHT: 100%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;○ 교직원 및 학생증 바코드가 잘 읽히지 않는 경우 : </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 8pt; COLOR: #ff0000; LINE-HEIGHT: 100%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">신청즉시 발급</span></p>\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 100%; TEXT-ALIGN: left\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 8pt; COLOR: #0000ff; LINE-HEIGHT: 100%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;○ 졸업생 및 지역주민 : </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 8pt; COLOR: #ff0000; LINE-HEIGHT: 100%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">이용신청서 제출시 발급</span></p>\n            </td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr>\n            <td style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt; BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.4pt solid\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"197\" height=\"138\">\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><img height=\"131\" src=\"http://www.kumoh.ac.kr/file/upload/Image/2_2.jpg\" width=\"181\" alt=\"\"></p>\n            </td>\n            <td style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt; BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.4pt solid\" valign=\"top\" width=\"449\" height=\"138\">\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 100%; TEXT-ALIGN: left\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; COLOR: #000080; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;2. 열람실 및 좌석번호 선택</span></p>